---
/* ============================================================================
   PreviewBanner — fixed top bar shown only on staging PR/branch previews
   ============================================================================
   Reads `import.meta.env.PUBLIC_PREVIEW_LABEL` at build time. The label is
   set by deploy-staging.yml only for non-main builds (pull_request events
   and workflow_dispatch with a non-main ref). When unset, the component
   renders nothing — production builds and main-branch staging builds have
   no banner.

   Why it's permanent (not dismissible) per Sean direction 2026-05-25:
   "the preview banner is the most obvious signal (aside from the URL
   subdomain) that I'm on staging. Keep it fixed and above all other
   elements permanently. If I need to see something behind it, I'll
   change the element to display: none in the dev tools."

   Z-index: 99999 — above the site header (z-100), the nav drawer
   (z-200), the AI search modal (z-300), the nozzle (z-30), the scroll
   indicator (z-40), and anything else the site renders. This is the
   "always on top" preview marker.

   Visual: high-contrast orange/yellow gradient. Deliberately NOT in the
   site's design palette (cyan / purple / brass) — the banner should
   read as "system chrome, not page content" so a reviewer never confuses
   it for an intentional design element. */

const previewLabel = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_PREVIEW_LABEL;
---

{previewLabel && (
  <div class="preview-banner" role="status" aria-label="Staging preview environment">
    <span class="preview-banner__icon" aria-hidden="true">⚠</span>
    <span class="preview-banner__text">PREVIEW: {previewLabel}</span>
  </div>
)}

<style>
  .preview-banner {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 99999;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      #FF6B35 0%,
      #FFB800 50%,
      #FF6B35 100%
    );
    color: #1A1A1A;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    /* Prevent user-select so a reviewer dragging on the page text doesn't
       accidentally select the banner. */
    user-select: none;
    /* Truncate long PR titles rather than wrap (banner stays single-line). */
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .preview-banner__icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .preview-banner__text {
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
</style>
